{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38067","headline":"寄禅师 · 韩偓","name":"寄禅师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"他心明与此心同，妙用忘言理暗通。\n气运阴阳成世界，水浮天地寄虚空。\n劫灰聚散铢锱黑，日御奔驰茧栗红。\n万物尽遭风鼓动，唯应禅室静无风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38067.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38067","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}